        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "63. Voting shall be conducted by a Joint Committee composed of three (3) persons appointed by the Employer and three (3) selected by the Union. The departmental units for the purpose of voting shall be determined by the Joint Committee in each hospital.",
